module Encyclopedia where

-- Generated from .tmp-night/fable-1111/pending/tree-of-life/foods.json by out/tools/gen_data.py. One culinary
-- kind per food (a tomato is in Vegetables, a peanut in Seeds: the closed list has no Nuts kind). Every food
-- names the living thing it comes from; giant fennel, lesser burdock, cutleaf nightshade and thorn apple give
-- none here. Five tomato varieties sit below Tomato (a food below a food), each from the tomato plant.
-- A supplied example, not a nutrition or safety claim.

@label "Foodstuff"
@description "A food of this collection, a kind of food, or all foods. Each is a name; its facts and pictures sit beside it."
